<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Break</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>break</a>
</pre>
<p>When a guard has you in handcuffs, you can try to break them. It takes 
strength: the stronger you are, the better your chances, but even the 
strongest succeed only now and then (about one try in five at strength 
100). You can try once a minute.
</p><p>If you fail, the guard slaps you hard for trying: it costs you some hit 
points and endurance. If you succeed, the cuffs snap and you are free, but 
you are now a wanted outlaw, and the law wants you dead.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Laws</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Arrests</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cuff</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Wanted</a>
</pre>




</div>